WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
They buried a man alive with a bell tied

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:06.200
to his finger. You see, people were so

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.160
scared of waking up in a coffin that

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.040
graves came with a little bell on top,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.840
tied by a string to the body's finger.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.560
Except when his bell starts ringing at

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.760
2:00 in the morning, the guy next door

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.960
decides it's probably the wind. Then it

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.800
rings faster, and now the whole street

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.400
is out on their porches going, "You go

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.120
check. No, you go check." Somebody drags

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.080
the doctor out of bed, and he goes,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.240
"Bodies twitch. He's dead. I signed the

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.080
paper myself." But his wife isn't on her

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.960
porch. She's sitting in the dark with

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.120
the shovel by the door because she knows

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.160
that ring. Three short, one long, the

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:38.480
exact signal they practiced. Wait,

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.600
practiced? Well, he was never dead. He

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.240
owed money to half the town, so he faked

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.680
his death, and the second that bell

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.200
rang, she was supposed to grab the

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.120
shovel, [music] dig him up, and skip

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.840
town with him. Instead, she just sits

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.040
there all night listening to it ring

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:53.240
fast, then slow, then once every few

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:55.480
minutes until sunrise, when it finally

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:57.480
stops. You see, with him in the ground,

00:00:55.480 --> 00:01:01.480
every debt got buried right along with

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:01.480
him, and the house was all hers.

